      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "特征值",
          "steps": [
            "特征多项式：$\\det(N-\\lambda I) = \\det\\begin{bmatrix} -\\lambda & -c \\\\ c & -\\lambda \\end{bmatrix} = \\lambda^2 + c^2 = 0$",
            "解得：$\\lambda^2 = -c^2$",
            "$\\lambda = \\pm ic$（其中 $i$ 为虚数单位）",
            "**特征值为纯虚数：$\\lambda_1 = ic, \\lambda_2 = -ic$**",
            "验证：确实都是纯虚数形式 $0 \\pm ici$"
