      "math_structure": {
        "type": "skew_symmetric_inverse_verification",
        "template": "交代矩阵逆矩阵也是交代矩阵的具体验证",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 7,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "逆矩阵验证",
          "steps": [
            "$\\det(P) = 0 \\cdot 0 - 1 \\cdot (-1) = 1 \\neq 0$，故 $P$ 可逆",
            "计算 $P^{-1}$：$P^{-1} = \\frac{1}{\\det(P)}\\begin{bmatrix} 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}$",
            "验证 $PP^{-1} = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix} 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\end{bmatrix} = I$ ✓",
            "验证 $(P^{-1})^T = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}^T = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}$",
            "验证 $-P^{-1} = -\\begin{bmatrix} 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}$",
            "因为 $(P^{-1})^T \\neq -P^{-1}$...让我重新计算。",
            "$(P^{-1})^T = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}^T = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix} = P^{-1}$",
            "这意味着 $P^{-1}$ 是对称的，不是交代的。让我检查 $P^{-1}$ 的计算。",
            "实际上，$P^{-1} = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}$",
            "$(P^{-1})^T = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}$",
            "$-P^{-1} = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}$",
            "确实 $(P^{-1})^T = -P^{-1}$，故 $P^{-1}$ 是交代矩阵 ✓",
            "**结论：$P^{-1} = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}$ 是交代矩阵。**"
          ]
        }
