          "steps": [
            "验证 $Q$ 是交代矩阵：",
            "$$Q^T = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0 \\end{bmatrix} = -Q$$",
            "确实是交代矩阵 ✓",
            "利用性质：对于 $n \\times n$ 交代矩阵 $Q$，有 $\\det(Q^T) = \\det(-Q)$",
            "因为 $Q^T = -Q$，故 $\\det(Q) = \\det(-Q) = (-1)^3 \\det(Q) = -\\det(Q)$",
            "因此 $2\\det(Q) = 0$，即 $\\det(Q) = 0$",
            "直接计算验证：按第一列展开",
            "$$\\det(Q) = 0 \\cdot M_{11} - (-1) \\cdot M_{21} + (-2) \\cdot M_{31}$$",
            "$$= 1 \\cdot \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 0 \\end{vmatrix} - 2 \\cdot \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\end{vmatrix}$$",
            "$$= 1 \\cdot (0+6) - 2 \\cdot (3-0) = 6 - 6 = 0$$",
            "**答：$\\det(Q) = 0$**"
          ]
        }
